marketing issues

AdHoc Builds - How to produce builds for Chillingo to test + QA Checklist
Chillingo Assets - Logos, Videos, Crystal images and other Chillingo files
Documents - Explanatory, legal, schedule and process documents
Game Assets - A series of art assets that need to be completed to help marketing and PR

Each of those folders will help you create assets for your game.  The most important folder is the game asset folder which has a number of art assets that are the highest priority.  The game asset folder is split into the following sections :-

App Store - Highest priority.  Make sure you follow naming conventions.  This art is required by apple to feature your game.  You need to create two assets the title and background images which must be layered .psd files 
Crystal Banner - needed to market game on crystal
High Quality Art - Not required but very useful.  This is artwork that would be suitable for press i.e 300 DPI+.  Any assets you have are useful
Video - If you have raw video or gameplay footage please send it through.  If you have youtube links send those over also
Website -  There are a number of banner assets that are needed to create your Chillingo Gamepage.
